  "details": "It's API bug, so isn't linked to a version.\n\nHaving an issue with using Worlds API. Instance request returns all users from instance, even if they already left.\n\nSteps:\n1. Fetch world by ID (/api/1/worlds/{id})\n2. Take any instance from \"instances\" (for example, [\"1\", 5])\n3. Fetch the instance (/api/1/worlds/{id}/{instance})\n4. Look at the \"users\" array.\nEven if we have seen 5 users when requesting world, we may see more (in my attempt, 34 users) in world.\nThis number may even be more than the Hard Max -capacity * 2 (I have seen instance with like 58/22 by API)\n\nNothing extra, just reproduce steps with popular world and for example instance ID 1",
